    "purpose": "Reference bundle for research, pilot documentation, IPR-based audit-trail modelling, hash-only evidence records, and fail-closed verification experiments.",
    "public_position": "This file is an R&D reference artifact. It is not a legal standard, not a regulated certification scheme, not an eIDAS qualified trust service, not a public authority registry, and not a production compliance framework by itself.",
    "operational_boundary": "The protocol reference describes minimized public records, deterministic hashing, signatures, append-only ledgers, and verification logic for IPR AI Audit Trail experiments. It does not require public custody of personal data, confidential payloads, private keys, financial assets, or regulated identity documents."
